{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat /home/micha/.codex/plugins/cache/openai-curated-remote/sites/1.1.3/skills/sites/references/preview/local.md'","aggregated_output":"# Local preview\n\nFor the `portable` profile, selected whenever `SITES_MANAGED_LINUX_CONTAINER` is not `1`, including on Linux devices.\n\nIn a visible task with a user-facing preview tool, run the project's dev script or a static HTTP server (preferably with live reload) in a retained session after any required installation. Check that the representative page returns a successful HTTP response, then open the server's printed Local URL with `open_in_codex` or equivalent. Use supported forwarding when execution is remote; loopback on another host is not a device preview.\n\nReuse the server and Site tab through edits and publication. For a background task or an environment without user-facing preview, start a server only when needed for the work. Request network permissions when required for the server and its readiness check. Stop the owned server during final teardown.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"node --input-type=module <<'EOF'\nimport {randomInt} from 'node:crypto';\nimport {mkdirSync,writeFileSync} from 'node:fs';\nconst titles=['Dodge & Weave','Dodgeroo','Dodge the Odds','Dodgy Laps','Dodge Me Maybe','Dodge City Circuit','Dodge a Little','Dodge Around','Dodge After Dark','Dodge Parade','Dodge Riot','Dodge Fever','Dodge-O-Rama','Dodge the Rush','Dodge Loop','Dodge Patrol','Dodge & Roll','Dodge That\"'!'\"','Dodge Express','Dodge Lightning','Dodge Orbit','Dodge Trouble','Dodge Daze','Dodge Derby','Dodge Hustle','Dodge Comet','Dodge Jive','Dodge Shuffle','Dodge Happy','Dodge Motion','Dodge Encore','Dodge Boulevard','Dodge Dash','Dodge Whirl','Dodge Circuit','Dodge Party','Dodge & Zoom','Dodge Side Up','Dodge Galaxy','Dodge Alley','Dodge Rumble','Dodge Pocket','Dodge Twist','Dodge Royale','Dodge Tangle','Dodge Groove','Dodge Velocity','Dodge Moxie','Dodge Tango','Dodge Disco'];\nconst index=randomInt(titles.length),title=titles[index];\nconst slug=title.replace(/&/g,'and').replace(/[\"'^a-zA-Z0-9]+/g,'\"'-').replace(/\"'^-|-$/g,'\"'')+'-Dodge-Em-1980-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191336';\nmkdirSync(slug);writeFileSync(slug+'/title-selection.json',JSON.stringify({title,slug,method:'node:crypto.randomInt',selectedIndex:index,candidateCount:titles.length},null,2));\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({title,slug}));\nEOF\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
